  <h2>1. Products, ingredients, and allergies</h2>
  <p>
    Chocolates are handmade in small batches. Product ingredients and available flavours can
    vary; check the product information and packaging, or contact us before ordering if you have
    a dietary or allergy question. Tell us about allergies before placing an order. The shop
    states that it can guarantee nut-free preparation, but products contain chocolate and some
    contain milk; the shop cannot make products suitable for chocolate or milk allergies. Do not
    order if you are allergic to chocolate or milk. Contact us to discuss other ingredient or
    flavour exclusions before ordering.
  </p>
  <p>
    Products are subject to availability. If the shop cannot fulfil an order, we will contact
    you and arrange an appropriate resolution, including a refund where applicable.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Order preparation and payment</h2>
  <p>
    Orders require at least 3 to 4 days for preparation. Allow that time before the date you need
    the order and contact the shop before ordering if your event is sooner. Product prices are
    displayed in Indian rupees. Payment at checkout covers the product subtotal only; delivery
    is not included. Razorpay processes the product payment through its secure checkout.
  </p>
  <p>
    Immediately after an order is placed, the shop will discuss the delivery option and quote
    the delivery fee using the contact details provided. The delivery fee must be accepted and
    paid separately before dispatch. The order is not ready for dispatch until the delivery
    arrangements and fee are confirmed. See the <a href="../shipping-policy/">Shipping Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Delivery and event dates</h2>
  <p>
    The delivery pin is used to estimate straight-line distance from the shop. At or within
    30 km, the system suggests manual Porter booking; beyond 30 km, it suggests a manually
    arranged courier. These are not automatic bookings or guarantees of service. Deliveries are
    available across India where a courier service can serve the address. The shop will confirm
    the available option and fee with you.
  </p>
  <p>
    Where an event date is provided, delivery is planned for two days before the event or on the
    event date, depending on location and the arrangement confirmed with you. Delivery estimates
    depend on preparation and the delivery provider and are not guaranteed arrival times.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Cancellation and refunds</h2>
  <p>
    If you decline the delivery fee when it is quoted immediately after placing the order, the
    product payment will be fully refunded. Once you accept the quoted delivery fee, a
    customer-requested cancellation is not refundable, except where a refund is required by
    applicable law or these terms. If the shop cannot fulfil an accepted order, contact you, or
    arrange the confirmed delivery, we will work with you on an appropriate resolution and
    refund where applicable.
  </p>
  <p>
    Contact us within one day of delivery if an order is damaged, incorrect, or incomplete.
    Damaged items are generally eligible for a full refund; the shop will assess the issue and
    confirm the appropriate full or partial refund. For an incorrect order, we will offer a
    refund or replacement. If return of the items is needed, the shop will cover the return
    courier charge. These terms do not limit any rights that cannot legally be excluded.
  </p>

